#. settings-schema.json->show-settings-icon->tooltip
msgid ""
"If disabled, you can still access the settings by right-clicking on the "
"edges of the dock."
msgstr ""
"Ha le van tiltva, a beállításokat továbbra is elérheted, ha a dokk "
"szélein jobb egérgombbal kattintasz."

